{"name": "Hover Point", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hover Point</strong> is a minimalist, physics-based bullet hell where movement is your only weapon.<br/>Navigate your way through chaotic swarms and screen-filling bosses in a pure arcade experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074780/extras/6f55666d34746f465be712bff720cb0c.poster.avif?t=1781153624\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074780/extras/6f55666d34746f465be712bff720cb0c.webm?t=1781153624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074780/extras/6f55666d34746f465be712bff720cb0c.mp4?t=1781153624\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control your character with your controller thumbstick, or keyboard (WASD), or even just your mouse movement.<br/>Aiming and shooting are fully automated, allowing you to focus entirely on the dance of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074780/extras/0b06a906ebe568c04188844de19e9ff5.poster.avif?t=1781153624\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074780/extras/0b06a906ebe568c04188844de19e9ff5.webm?t=1781153624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074780/extras/0b06a906ebe568c04188844de19e9ff5.mp4?t=1781153624\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every level-up offers a choice of random <strong>Augments</strong>. These are powerful min-maxing tools: every boost to your strength comes with a cost. Choose wisely, every augment you take also applies to your enemies as well! If you get stronger, the swarm does too. Currently have\u00a0<strong>40+ Unique Augments</strong> (and growing!) to define your build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074780/extras/6babbcf48f1bc9472d1c9b4377bbc5ae.poster.avif?t=1781153624\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074780/extras/6babbcf48f1bc9472d1c9b4377bbc5ae.webm?t=1781153624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074780/extras/6babbcf48f1bc9472d1c9b4377bbc5ae.mp4?t=1781153624\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Skill Maze : Navigate a non-linear meta-progression path to unlock new potential upgrades for future runs.\u00a0Chart your path to power. Each node reached in the maze adds a new potential upgrade to your level-up pool. Build the deck you want to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074780/extras/1d8a30c6bdb4a8e2c565bc41b398aadf.poster.avif?t=1781153624\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074780/extras/1d8a30c6bdb4a8e2c565bc41b398aadf.webm?t=1781153624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074780/extras/1d8a30c6bdb4a8e2c565bc41b398aadf.mp4?t=1781153624\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience <strong>Asynchronous Multiplayer</strong>. Join or leave a lobby at any time to play alongside others. You\u2019ll see other players fighting their own battles in the same space, but your threats are yours alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074780/extras/922f1d04a7709fdabecfd30ad688ad92.poster.avif?t=1781153624\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074780/extras/922f1d04a7709fdabecfd30ad688ad92.webm?t=1781153624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074780/extras/922f1d04a7709fdabecfd30ad688ad92.mp4?t=1781153624\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prove your skills on the global stage. The <strong>Steam Leaderboard</strong> tracks your efficiency and resets every two weeks, giving you a fresh chance to claim the top spot and prove you are the ultimate survivor.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Hover Point is a physics-based rogue-lite bullet hell where movement is your weapon. Dodge chaotic swarms with auto-fire action, build your skill tree, and climb global leaderboards. Master the chaos solo or in co-op via mouse-only, keyboard-only, or controller-only playstyles.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074780/29a304ed5dc1b954d62eda27edfbf0711841583d/header.jpg?t=1781153624", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Early Access", "Action Roguelike", "Bullet Hell", "Shoot 'Em Up", "Top-Down Shooter", "Twin Stick Shooter"], "developers": "chaqibrahim", "publishers": "chaqibrahim", "release_date": "May 1, 2026", "price": "$4.99", "appid": "4074780", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "24 January 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/snCDp1ic11s", "first_seen": 1769209200.0, "review_rank": 1364}